      maturity: '<strong>Current maturity:</strong> the Ascription lifecycle and its transitions are implemented, and the Blackboard produces sealed, replayable candidate contributions. <strong>Remaining work:</strong> the ITIP disposition surface that presents evidence, provenance, and evaluations to an accountable human.',
