      maturity: '<strong>Current maturity:</strong> Definition and Ascription authoring, lifecycle history, and typed Mechanism execution are implemented, with an ITIP appraisal integration proof. <strong>Remaining work:</strong> the appraisal, simulation, and audit surfaces that return this evidence to the organisation.',
      sub: 'This is the flow that closes the map. Intent becomes typed Definitions and Ascriptions; those govern operation; operation produces appraisal, simulation, and audit evidence; that evidence returns to the intent that produced it. Without this return path, regulation and disposition would be open-loop — constraint and action with no corrective signal. Systemic viability depends on the return, not on the outbound half.',
